<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-LEIPZIG WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEIPZIG WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LEIPZIG, Germany 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results</p>
<p>from the $450,000 women's international tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p>Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Gloria Pizzichini (Italy) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) beat Anne Gaelle Sidot (France)</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Nathalie Tauziat (France) 5-7 6-2 6-3 Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Silvia Talaja (Croatia) 6-1 6-2.</p>
</text>
